  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-10-24T05:31:55.340Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you turn contact debug on and change avatars, the next avatar's head contact will be completely messed up if the avatar has a sizable height difference. This is only corrected by rejoining an instance or resetting an avatar. This also only seems to happen locally, other players will see your contacts normally.\n\nThis bug applies to both the live and current open beta builds.",
